{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/933171-who-here-writes-stories-in-other-sites","id":933171,"title":"Who Here Writes Stories In Other Sites?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-17T17:58:43-07:00","id":933171,"title":"Who Here Writes Stories In Other Sites?","content":"I'm asking because I think there's a chance most roleplayers are also into writing fiction in general. And also because I'm hoping to find a critique partner. <br /> <br /> I have written some stories for the SCP wiki, and I've recently gotten back into the swing of writing. In case anyone is interested in receiving or giving feedback on their works, feel free to say so here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T18:57:22-07:00","id":933195,"title":"","content":"I write a Star Wars fanfiction about institutional failure in the Old Republic, Empire, and New Republic. It's my baby. It's what I write when I don't have paid contracts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T19:23:31-07:00","id":933203,"title":"","content":"I write for the wiki for a C&amp;C mod that somehow morphed into a little alt-universe, as of right now we've got a small close knit community going for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T19:26:31-07:00","id":933204,"title":"","content":"I'm currently looking at getting in Storium, a website that's sort of a middle ground between collaborative creating writing exercise, play by post RP, and card-based narrative RPG.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T17:09:18-07:00","id":933652,"title":"","content":"I have a novel series I am working on. The first book is being worked on by my editor and I am getting started on a short story set in the same universe that I will send to various short story mags to promote the book. The universe of the book is a open magic version of our world where magic was always public (Basically the supernatural beings mostly avoided persecution by making themselves useful to the mundane authorities, along with a few events from various world mythologies that turned out different (for example, the story of Tamamo no Mae in Japan has a happier ending in my world that is the reason therianthropes exist openly in Asia, whereas the leaders of the European weres basically became vassals of the various mundane royals).<br /> <br /> I won't give spoilers for the novel, but the short story is basically a customer service hell tale of the clerks, not always wrong, CA Pinkham's off the menu sort, starring a pack of teenage werewolves (and a couple other sorts of teen supernaturals) trying to survive retail work at a mall in the aughts.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T18:32:17-07:00","id":933678,"title":"","content":"I write my Exalted Quest here in the forums (See signature) . I got some other Non fan fiction stuff in various states of development. Going to go for the Changeling anthology too. <br /> <br /> I got a blog where I post all my random stuff. <a href=\"https://acidspiders.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://acidspiders.wordpress.com</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T18:18:43-07:00","id":934834,"title":"","content":"I wrote three stories on fanfiction.net, many years ago--I think my last one went up in '04. I deleted them some time ago.<br /> <br /> There was a time when I wanted to be a novelist, but I gave up on that dream. Then I un-gave up on it a couple months ago, when my current job sent me on a crap project that convinced me I don't want to work in this industry for the rest of my life. I've started to use my down time to flex my old skills by little bits of fiction. Perhaps I'll take a crack at a short story in the near future.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T19:00:24-07:00","id":934849,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daydreamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/933171-who-here-writes-stories-in-other-sites?p=934834#post934834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wrote three stories on fanfiction.net, many years ago--I think my last one went up in '04. I deleted them some time ago.<br /> <br /> There was a time when I wanted to be a novelist, but I gave up on that dream. Then I un-gave up on it a couple months ago, when my current job sent me on a crap project that convinced me I don't want to work in this industry for the rest of my life. I've started to use my down time to flex my old skills by little bits of fiction. Perhaps I'll take a crack at a short story in the near future.</div> </div> </div> </div>I never thought I'd ever be paid to write. It just sort of happened. Don't give up, if it's what you want. I know that sounds cheesy, but it happened to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T13:00:33-07:00","id":938287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hm8453a</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/933171-who-here-writes-stories-in-other-sites?p=933195#post933195\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I write a Star Wars fanfiction about institutional failure in the Old Republic, Empire, and New Republic. It's my baby. It's what I write when I don't have paid contracts.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Mind posting a link to your fics or PMing me? The premise sounds interesting. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T13:21:18-07:00","id":938298,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tytalus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/933171-who-here-writes-stories-in-other-sites?p=938287#post938287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Mind posting a link to your fics or PMing me? The premise sounds interesting. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Sure! <br /> <br /> I'd really appreciate crit on everything from storytelling and character development to syntax and structure, but please keep syntax and structure crit to chapters three and on--I wrote one and two when I was fifteen, and since have received academic instruction in creative writing and started writing professionally. I'd also really, really appreciate reviews posted to the site itself. You don't need an account to leave one. Thanks for reading!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.fanfiction.net/s/11099086/1/The-New-Order\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.fanfiction.net/s/11099086/1/The-New-Order</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}